 <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কার্যক্রমে</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">তার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বাস্তব</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">অভিজ্ঞতা</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এই</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইয়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রতিফলিত</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">হয়েছে।</span><o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\"><br>\r\n📖</span> <b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইয়ের</span>\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রধান</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">তথ্য</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নাম</span>:</b> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদকের</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সাতসতেরো</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">লেখক</span>:</b> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কমান্ডার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">খন্দকার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">আল</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মইন</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ভাষা</span>:</b> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বাংলা</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">পৃষ্ঠা</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সংখ্যা</span>:</b> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">আনুমানিক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">১২০</span>–<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">২০০</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">পৃষ্ঠা</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ধরণ</span>:</b> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সমাজভিত্তিক</span> / <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদকবিষয়ক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিশ্লেষণ</span> / <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সচেতনতামূলক</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">📌</span> <b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রকাশনী</span> (Publication):</b><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">👉</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কভারে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নির্দিষ্ট</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রকাশনীর</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নাম</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">উল্লেখ</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নেই।</span><o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">📌</span> <b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইটির</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মূল</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বক্তব্য</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ও</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিষয়বস্তু</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">“<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদকের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সাতসতেরো</span>” <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মূলত</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদকের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিস্তার</span>, <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এর</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ভয়াবহতা</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এবং</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সমাজে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এর</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রভাব</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নিয়ে</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">আলোচনা</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">করে।</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">🔹</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এখানে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">দেখানো</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">হয়েছে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কীভাবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">তরুণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সমাজকে</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ধ্বংসের</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">দিকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নিয়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">যাচ্ছে।</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">🔹</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইটিতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদক</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ব্যবসার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নেপথ্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কাহিনি</span>, <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">অপরাধচক্র</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সামাজিক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কারণগুলো</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিশ্লেষণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">করা</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">হয়েছে।</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">🔹</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">লেখক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বাস্তব</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">অভিজ্ঞতার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ভিত্তিতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">মাদক</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রতিরোধের</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">উপায়</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সচেতনতার</span> <span style=\"fo